    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, just getting the Q3 projections ready for the board meeting. i've been looking at the cloud computing costs for the Iceland site and they're way higher than we budgeted for. the new efficiency directive from HQ says we need to cut back on the compute-heavy stuff. i'm thinking we move the absorption parameter control over to the static scheduled system we used last year to save on the overhead. thoughts on how that'll affect the intake numbers for next quarter?",
